# Keep source diffs readable and prevent model/checkpoint content from being
# treated as text if a maintainer works with a local, ignored artifact.
*.java text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.jsonl text eol=lf
*.csv text eol=lf
*.onnx binary
*.bin binary
*.apk binary
*.aab binary
*.safetensors binary

# Do not enable Git LFS here: the required contextual model is fetched and
# checksum-verified outside Git (see MODEL_SETUP.md).
